div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.00<br/>June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>A place located deep below the <a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Mines\">Formorgar Mines</a>. It is said that the Ice Witch mistress is asleep in this crypt and that nobody is able to wake her from her slumber.\n</p><p>The Yakchal Crypt is in the final room of <a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a>. Near the north-east stone, there is a large room sealed by doors and inhabited by around 20 <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Witch\">Ice Witches</a>. To wake Yakchal up, use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Frozen%20Starlight\">Frozen Starlight</a> on her sarcophagus. There is a 10% chance that the starlight breaks in the process.\n<br/>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Yakchal way\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"118\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yakchal_way_8f6cd8.jpg\" width=\"128\"/></span><br/>\nThe \"X\" marks the obelisk for the quest, the green arrows mark places where you could levitate up, in order to get to  a save spot where you could rest. The pink arrow marks the Crypt.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Monsters inside the room</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-al